		</TRID_INFO>
		<TRIO_INFO>
			<TRAN name="obacp_opop_064r" title="종합계좌 기준 계좌Control 조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="39" _ulen="31" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" inout="out" _len="289" _ulen="219" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNO^고객번호^10^0^0^0^0^0^0
CSNM^고객명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0
MANG_BRCD^관리 지점코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
ACNT_STAT_CODE^계좌 상태 코드^1^0^0^0^0^0^0
RCNO^실명확인번호^13^0^0^0^0^0^0
CUST_GRAD_CODE^고객등급코드^2^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
			<TRAN name="obcpp_fnds_803r" title="부서코드 조회" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="70" _ulen="56" >

DPCD^부서코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
DPNM^부서명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="OutBlock1" occurs="30" inout="out" _len="70" _ulen="56" >

DPCD^부서코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0
DPNM^부서명^40^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
				<TRBLOCK name="NextBlock1" inout="next" _len="39" _ulen="31" >

DPCD^부서코드^4^0^0^0^0^0^0

				</TRBLOCK>
			</TRAN>
		</TRIO_INFO>
